    <span class="tag tag-cyan">LLM Post-training</span>
    <span class="tag tag-green">Interactive</span>
  </div>
  <h1>Post-training is (Massive) Supervised Learning</h1>
  <p class="lead">The prevailing LLM paradigm has quietly reverted to the BERT era. A model initialized from <em>random noise</em> — zero pre-training — reaches 79–92% of a fully pre-trained model's performance on AIME, HMMT, and competitive programming benchmarks after SFT. Post-training is not unlocking emergent capabilities; it is fitting distributions.</p>
  <div class="post-hero-meta">
